@startuml

actor User
participant "convexpolygonarea.py" as Main
participant Polygon
participant PolygonAreaCalculator as Calculator

User -> Main: provide polygon input
Main -> Polygon: Polygon(vertices)
Polygon --> Main: polygon object

Main -> Calculator: get_instance()
Calculator --> Main: singleton calculator

Main -> Calculator: calculate_area(polygon)
Calculator -> Polygon: get_vertex(index)
Polygon --> Calculator: Point
Calculator -> Polygon: get_vertex(next_index)
Polygon --> Calculator: Point
Calculator --> Main: area

Main --> User: print area

@enduml